{"id":"vod_sn_38510","vodId":"38510","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"宝石商人理查德的谜鉴定","name_cn":"宝石商人理查德的谜鉴定","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/de6a8e24cd1d34fac5d19a27d207a7c2.jpg"},"summary":"中田正义（内田雄马 配音）是一位成熟稳重的大学生，人生目标是成为公务员，内心充满了正义感的他总是给人一种非常正能量的感觉。某天夜里，中田偶遇了一位遭到了醉鬼纠缠的外国人，后来才知道，他的名字叫做理查德（樱井孝宏 配音），因为其杰出的坚定宝石的技巧，而被称为“行走的宝石”。　　理查德经营着一家珠宝店，中田的手中有一枚祖母一直珍藏着的宝石，他将宝石拿给了理查德鉴定，没想到就此揭开了祖母深藏了多年的秘密。以此为契机，理查德邀请中田到自己的店里来打工，中田就此步入了一个自己闻所未闻的全新世界之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5EPYYRjjd81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n9ume8wBZw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vXrhWFcQ8F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tn84m8m9Si1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g6EBnZYW0B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/29GE81hmtH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/miFKVWFhnX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sKXAdSy3UH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RXEQTzdJzH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c2CH6AuxKS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rj766pRFDL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HAA98wrcys1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.987Z"}